            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good. Came out super moist and rich. But it's not a mocha cake. There was a *slight* taste off the coffee liqueur but it really reads like a vanilla cake. I would like to make this with a chocolate/devil's food mix instead of yellow, and add some instant coffee to the mix. I added a bit of instant coffee to the glaze also a bit of salt, that was good.",
